# that a clean clone could recompute none of the batch-4 / dev-loop numbers: 14 dirs 20260910T23* and
# 23 dirs 20260911T1*-devloop-*, every file but capture-before.jsonl (pre-run probe residue, 263 MB,
# read by no script; hashes in evaluation/gate/artifacts/run-records-committed-2026-09-12.json).

# attribution 的两个共享暂存路径：run-once.sh 每次运行前删除、各阶段重写、
# 再拷进 runs/<run_id>/。留在库里只会让工作树永远是脏的，而入库的那份不过是
# "最后一次提交时恰好是哪次运行"，会被误读成有意义的基准。每次运行的那份在
# runs/<run_id>/ 里，那才是记录。（provenance 下的同类文件本来就已忽略。）
evaluation/attribution/artifacts/run-artifacts.json
evaluation/attribution/artifacts/used-events.jsonl
